{"synced":[{"time":14.6,"text":"ひたすら何かを待つだけ?"},{"time":14.6,"text":"hitasura nanika o matsu dake?"},{"time":21.53,"text":"現実と向き合うのは辛いけど"},{"time":21.53,"text":"genjitsu to mukiau no wa tsurai kedo"},{"time":29.06,"text":"and I can't go this way 出来ることは"},{"time":29.06,"text":"and I can't go this way dekiru koto wa"},{"time":36.47,"text":"すべてを愛して戦うことで"},{"time":36.47,"text":"subete o aishite tatakau koto de"},{"time":43.49,"text":"今度も決して楽じゃないけれどね"},{"time":43.49,"text":"kondo mo kesshite raku janai keredo ne"},{"time":51.02,"text":"命の歩立ち止まらないよ"},{"time":51.02,"text":"inochi no ayumi tachidomaranai yo"},{"time":58.58,"text":"You look at me〜one"},{"time":58.58,"text":"You look at me~one"},{"time":61.88,"text":"闇夜が恐れるもの"},{"time":61.88,"text":"yamiyo ga osoreru mono"},{"time":65.77,"text":"それは眩しい光"},{"time":65.77,"text":"sore wa mabushii hikari"},{"time":69.43,"text":"ひとすじ目指す夢を照らして"},{"time":69.43,"text":"hitosuji mezasu yume o terashite"},{"time":75.03,"text":"ゼロから始めてみる"},{"time":75.03,"text":"zero kara hajimete miru"},{"time":80.44,"text":"とらわれないでいてね"},{"time":80.44,"text":"torawarenaide ite ne"},{"time":83.97,"text":"成しとげる気持ちが一番必要"},{"time":83.97,"text":"nashitogeru kimochi ga ichiban hitsuyou"},{"time":98.55,"text":"どこかで for you 伝えられる?"},{"time":98.55,"text":"dokoka de for you tsutaerareru?"},{"time":105.39,"text":"これだけは覚えていてほしいから"},{"time":105.39,"text":"kore dake wa oboete ite hoshii kara"},{"time":112.48,"text":"You make me smile 離れていてもね"},{"time":112.48,"text":"You make me smile hanarete itemo ne"},{"time":119.93,"text":"You make me sing 気持ちは感じられるよ"},{"time":119.93,"text":"You make me sing kimochi wa kanjirareru yo"},{"time":126.86,"text":"いつでも心あなたに向けている"},{"time":126.86,"text":"itsudemo kokoro anata ni mukete iru"},{"time":134.3,"text":"他の誰かに代わる事はない"},{"time":134.3,"text":"hoka no dareka ni kawaru koto wa nai"},{"time":142.07,"text":"You look at me〜one"},{"time":142.07,"text":"You look at me~one"},{"time":145.38,"text":"窓辺にそう花束を"},{"time":145.38,"text":"madobe n